According to this model, the median monthly rent for a living unit in Oregon in 2020 was [`\$1267\text{.}`]
END_PGML_SOLUTION
Section::End();
############################################################ # Section ############################################################ Section::Begin("");
BEGIN_PGML According to this model, what will be the median rent for a living unit in Oregon in 2030?
[_]{$rentev[2]}{10}
END_PGML
############################################################ # Solution ############################################################
BEGIN_PGML_SOLUTION For the year 2030, [`x`] is [`30\text{:}`]
[```\newcommand{\substitute}[1]{{\color{blue}{{#1}}}}\newcommand{\amp}{&} \begin{aligned} 620+32.35(\substitute{30})\amp = 1590.50 \end{aligned} ```]
According to this model, the median monthly rent for a living unit in Oregon in 2030 will be [`\$1590.50\text{.}`]
