# Solution
############################################################

BEGIN_PGML_SOLUTION
Substitute [`[$x]`] in for the variable [`[$var]`] and simplify:

[```\newcommand{\amp}{&}
\begin{aligned}
\amp[$sol[0]]\\
\amp=[$sol[3]]\\
\amp=[$sol[7]]\\
\amp=[$answer]
\end{aligned}
```]

END_PGML_SOLUTION

