[`[$sum]`]

[@KeyboardInstructions('Separate the terms in your list using commas.')@]**

[_]{$ans}{20}

END_PGML

############################################################
# Solution
############################################################

BEGIN_PGML_SOLUTION
The terms are the pieces being added together. Any piece that is subtracted from other pieces can be viewed as adding a negative. So the terms are [`[$ans]\text{.}`]

END_PGML_SOLUTION

