BEGIN_PGML A famous fact about such a triangle is that [`c=\sqrt{a^2+b^2}\text{.}`] So if one leg [`a`] is [$a] inches long, and if the perimeter is [$c] inches long, then we have an equation [`[$left]=[$right]\text{.}`] Is the other leg [`[$proposed_solution]`] inches long?
