############################################################
# Body
############################################################

BEGIN_PGML
You hail a taxi and can only pay with cash. This cab service charges a flat fee of [`[$flat]`] and then charges [`[$rate]`] per mile. No tip is expected. You are carrying a total of [`[$cash]`] in cash with you. You want to know how many miles you can afford.

END_PGML

