BEGIN_PGML_SOLUTION
a.  The [`x`]-coordinate is [$xposneg[0]] and the [`y`]-coordinate is [$yposneg[0]], so the point is in the [$ul[0]] quadrant, which is Quadrant [$ans[0]].

a.  The [`x`]-coordinate is [$xposneg[1]] and the [`y`]-coordinate is [$yposneg[1]], so the point is in the [$ul[1]] quadrant, which is Quadrant [$ans[1]].

a.  The [`x`]-coordinate is [$xposneg[2]] and the [`y`]-coordinate is [$yposneg[2]], so the point is in the [$ul[2]] quadrant, which is Quadrant [$ans[2]].

a.  The [`x`]-coordinate is [$xposneg[3]] and the [`y`]-coordinate is [$yposneg[3]], so the point is in the [$ul[3]] quadrant, which is Quadrant [$ans[3]].

